title: Redoing the Ukrainian Congress of Soviets 
new-page: true
view-if: ukrainian_congresses = 1 and ukrainian_congress_timer = 0 and kharkiv_congress_seen != 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

A number of delegates from Kyiv have made the journey to Kharkiv for the "redo" 1st All-Ukrainian Congress of Soviets, although most opposition parties condemn the alternate congress, and are unwilling or unable to attend. Bolshevik militias are mobilized to ensure the congress goes smoothly. 

- @proceed_election : Begin the congress...

@proceed_election
on-arrival: {! Q.election_provinces = 'ukraine'; !}
go-to: election_algorithm.soviet
set-jump: election_results

@election_results
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!

Q.ukrainian_ca_timer = 10; 
Q.kharkiv_congress_seen = 1; 
Q.election_seat_total = 204; 

Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec += 0.1;
Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec += 0.5;
Q.b_election_votes_dec += 40;
Q.sdi_election_votes_dec = 0.2;
Q.left_m_election_votes_dec = 0.1;
Q.m_election_votes_dec = 0.1;
Q.right_m_election_votes_dec = 0;
Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec -= 2;
Q.bundist_election_votes_dec = 0.2;
Q.lsr_election_votes_dec += 5;
Q.sr_election_votes_dec *= 0.4; 
Q.ukrainian_sr_election_votes_dec -= 40;
Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec -= 1; 
Q.agrarian_election_votes_dec *= 0.5;
Q.polish_election_votes_dec *= 0.25;
Q.zionist_election_votes_dec *= 0.4;
Q.other_election_votes_dec += 0;

if (Q.ukraine_preparations > 0) { Q.b_election_votes_dec += (Q.ukraine_preparations / 2 ); Q.other_election_votes_dec -= (Q.ukraine_preparations / 2 ); }

window.mapElectionNormalize();

Q.coalition1 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec * 0.7) + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.4)))/100;
Q.coalition2 = Math.round(100*(Q.sdi_election_votes_dec + Q.left_m_election_votes_dec + Q.m_election_votes_dec + Q.right_m_election_votes_dec + Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec + Q.bundist_election_votes_dec + Q.sr_election_votes_dec + Q.ukrainian_sr_election_votes_dec + Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec + Q.agrarian_election_votes_dec + (Q.other_election_votes_dec*0.6)))/100;
Q.coalition3 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec * 0.5) + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.4)))/100;
Q.coalition4 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec * 0.4) + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.3)))/100;
Q.coalition5 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec * 0.2) + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.1)))/100;
Q.coalition6 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec * 0.3) + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.3)))/100;



if (typeof Q.election_seat_total != 'number' || Q.election_seat_total <= 0) {
    Q.election_seat_total = 204;
}
for (var party of Q.election_parties) {
    Q[party + '_election_r'] = Math.round(Q.election_seat_total * (Q[party + '_election_votes_dec'] || 0) / 100);
}
!}
on-display: {!
var data = [];
var rows = '<tr><th>Party</th><th>Vote Share</th></tr>';
for (var party of Q.election_parties) {
    var label = window.electionNames[party];
    var box = label.box || party;
    data.push({"id": party, "legend": label.legend, "name": label.legend, "seats": Q[party + '_election_r']});
    rows += '<tr><td><div class="party-box box ' + box + '"></div>' + label.table + '</td><td>' + (Q[party + '_election_votes_dec'] || 0) + '%</td></tr>';
}
data.forEach(function(d) {
    if (!Number.isFinite(d.seats)) {
        console.error("BAD SEAT VALUE", d.id, d.seats);
    }
});
document.getElementById("election_table").innerHTML = rows;
if (window && d3) {
    var width = 625;
    var height = 625;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50;
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("election_chart").style.height = width + "px";
    }
    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#election_chart").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

{!<svg id="election_chart" viewBox="0 0 625 310"> </svg>!}

{!<table id="election_table" class="soviet-table"></table>!}

The assembled congress is far more amenable to Bolshevik interests, allowing us to undo the damage of the earlier congress. 
  
- @bolshevik_coalition
- @agrarian_coalition


@bolshevik_coalition
title: [+ coalition1 +]% — The congress is dominated by proponents of soviet power. 
subtitle: Coalition of <span style="color: var(--bolshevik); font-weight: bold;">Bolsheviks</span>, <span style="color: var(--lsr); font-weight: bold;">Left-SRs</span>, and some <span style="color: var(--ukrainian_sd); font-weight: bold;">Social Democrats</span>.
choose-if: coalition1 > 50
go-to: congress_events

@agrarian_coalition
title: [+ coalition2 +]% — The oppositionists attempt to retake control.
unavailable-subtitle: Aoalition of <span style="color: var(--m); font-weight: bold;">Mensheviks</span>, <span style="color: var(--usr); font-weight: bold;">USRs</span>, <span style="color: var(--sr); font-weight: bold;">SRs</span>, <span style="color: var(--agrarian); font-weight: bold;">Agrarians</span>, and others. 
choose-if: coalition2 > 50
go-to: congress_events


@congress_events

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

With the congress firmly in our control, we can proceed with a Bolshevik agenda. 

- @void
- @denounce_rada
- @dissolve_upr
- @military
- @continue



@void
title: [+ coalition3 +]% — Declare all resolutions of the previous congress to be null and void. 
choose-if: coalition3 > 50
max-visits: 1
go-to: congress_events
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity += 1;
!}

@denounce_rada
title: [+ coalition4 +]% — Declare the Central Rada an illegitimate government and strip all support for it. 
choose-if: coalition4> 50
max-visits: 1
go-to: congress_events
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability += 1;
  Q.morale += 0.1;
  Q.upr_relation -= 30; 
!}

@dissolve_upr
title: [+ coalition5 +]% — Declare the dissolution of the Ukrainian People's Republic, and its replacement by a new "Ukrainian People's Republic of Soviets", which will be based in Kharkiv.  
choose-if: coalition5 > 50
max-visits: 1
go-to: congress_events
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability += 0.5;
  Q.morale += 0.1; Q.discipline += 0.05;
  Q.workers_b += 2; 
  Q.upr_relation -= 30; 
!}

@military
title: [+ coalition6 +]% — Call upon all soviet forces to resist the UPR and support the military uprisings against it. 
choose-if: coalition6 > 50
max-visits: 1
go-to: congress_events
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability += 2;
  Q.morale += 0.1; Q.discipline += 0.1;
  Q.workers_b += 1; 
  Q.upr_relation -= 20; 
!}
  
@continue
title: Conclude the congress...
go-to: root
